parassimpáticos?',NULL,'Resposta original confirmada; é o maior núcleo parassimpático do tronco cerebral.','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','Núcleo motor dorsal do nervo vago.'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-b5800f5b1e352e247117',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Diencéfalo e hipófise'),'De rostral para caudal, entre que estruturas ventriculares se encontra o sulco
hipotalâmico?',NULL,'A resposta original está correta.','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','Entre o buraco interventricular (de Monro), rostralmente, e o aqueduto cerebral, caudalmente.'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-5d9da9be3f06efd6b67f',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Nervos IX, X, XI e XII; espaços craniofaciais'),'Em que gânglio do nervo glossofaríngeo se encontra, as fibras referentes à inervação
do seio carotídeo?',NULL,'','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','No gânglio inferior do nervo glossofaríngeo (gânglio petroso).'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-eefe05fb9073bfb9d89b',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Sistema nervoso autónomo'),'Qual o componente funcional das fibras que enervam do ponto de vista
parassimpático a glândula lacrimal? Qual o gânglio onde sinaptizam?',NULL,'Resposta original confirmada; as fibras pré-ganglionares seguem pelo nervo facial e fazem sinapse no gânglio pterigopalatino para a via lacrimal.','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','Fibras eferentes viscerais gerais (parassimpáticas); gânglio pterigopalatino.'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-1bba703e755096b86759',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Diencéfalo e hipófise'),'Qual a comissura caudal à glândula pineal?',NULL,'','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','A comissura posterior.'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-ce1483ea06dd64cbf169',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Neurocrânio e ossificação'),'Quais as fissuras que dão acesso à fossa pterigopalatina?',NULL,'A resposta original está correta.','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','Fissura orbitária inferior e fissura pterigomaxilar.'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-a670e5e2ce65fb285a92',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Bolbo raquidiano e protuberância'),'O que origina no tronco cerebral, o tuberculum cinerum?',NULL,'','medium','published',unixepoch()*1000,(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT actor_id FROM _compendium_context),unixepoch()*1000,unixepoch()*1000,'[]','[]','short_answer','O tubérculo cinéreo recobre o trato espinhal e o núcleo espinhal do nervo trigémeo (V).'),('compendium-quiz-neuro-765f9caa440048d0875c',(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context),(SELECT id FROM quiz_topics WHERE curricular_unit_id=(SELECT unit_id FROM _compendium_context) AND title='Diencéfalo e hipófise'),'Qual é a hormona secretada pela glândula pineal? Em que parte do dia a sua
